No adult entertainment establishment or use restricted hereunder shall be located:
(1) Within 500 feet of any parcel of land which is either named or used for residential uses or purposes;
(2) Within 500 feet of any parcel of land upon which a church, school, governmental building, library, civic center, public park or playground is located;
